          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Connect & Reserve</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Contact {{BUSINESS_NAME}} for seasonal aromatherapy events, private series, and scent consultations. Safety-forward practice in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --bg-1: #f7efe6; /* sand */\\n      --accent: #b85a39; /* terracotta */\\n      --leaf: #556b2f; /* olive */\\n      --muted: #7a6f63; /* warm grey */\\n      --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);\\n      --max-w: 980px;\\n      --radius: 14px;\\n      font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;\\n      color-scheme: light;\\n    }\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg-1),#efe6dd);}\\n    .canvas{position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;opacity:0.9}\\n    svg.pattern{width:100%;height:100%;display:block}\\n    .page{max-width:var(--max-w);margin:48px auto;padding:36px;position:relative}\\n    nav{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:28px}\\n    nav a{color:var(--leaf);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:8px}\\n    nav a:hover{background:rgba(85,107,47,0.06)}\\n    header.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:28px;align-items:start}\\n    .intro{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(184,90,57,0.06),transparent);padding:28px;border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:0 6px 26px rgba(107,93,81,0.08)}\\n    h1{margin:0 0 8px 0;color:var(--accent);font-size:28px}\\n    p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5}\\n    .card{background:var(--glass);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);padding:18px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.6)}\\n    .contact-form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\\n    input,textarea,button,select{font:inherit;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(83,67,58,0.12);outline:none}\\n    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}\\n    .btn-primary{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#983f2b);color:white;border:none;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:10px;cursor:pointer}\\n    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n    .grid-3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .pill{background:#fff;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(83,67,58,0.06)}\\n    .small{font-size:13px}\\n    .process{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .step{flex:1;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(85,107,47,0.04),transparent);padding:12px;border-radius:10px}\\n    .faq{margin-top:22px;display:grid;gap:10px}\\n    .faq summary{cursor:pointer;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04)}\\n    .lead-magnet{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-top:20px}\\n    footer.cta{margin-top:28px;padding:18px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(184,90,57,0.12),rgba(85,107,47,0.04));display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    @media (max-width:900px){header.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}\\n      .grid-3{grid-template-columns:1fr}\\n      .page{margin:18px;padding:18px}\\n      footer.cta{flex-direction:column;gap:12px;align-items:stretch}\\n    }\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"canvas\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n    <svg class=\\\"pattern\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 1200 800\\\" preserveAspectRatio=\\\"none\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\">\\n      <defs>\\n        <linearGradient id=\\\"g1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\">\\n          <stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#f1e6dd\\\"/>\\n          <stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#f9f1ea\\\"/>\\n        </linearGradient>\\n        <pattern id=\\\"p\\\" width=\\\"200\\\" height=\\\"200\\\" patternUnits=\\\"userSpaceOnUse\\\" patternTransform=\\\"rotate(12)\\\">\\n          <rect width=\\\"200\\\" height=\\\"200\\\" fill=\\\"url(#g1)\\\"/>\\n          <g opacity=\\\"0.12\\\" fill=\\\"#b85a39\\\">\\n            <circle cx=\\\"30\\\" cy=\\\"30\\\" r=\\\"20\\\"/>\\n            <rect x=\\\"100\\\" y=\\\"100\\\" width=\\\"60\\\" height=\\\"60\\\" rx=\\\"10\\\"/>\\n            <path d=\\\"M160 30c-14 20-30 40-50 20\\\" stroke=\\\"#556b2f\\\" stroke-width=\\\"6\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\"/>\\n          </g>\\n        </pattern>\\n      </defs>\\n      <rect width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" fill=\\\"url(#p)\\\"/>\\n    </svg>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <main class=\\\"page\\\" id=\\\"main\\\">\\n    <nav aria-label=\\\"Primary navigation\\\">\\n      <a href=\\\"/index.html\\\">Gather</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/services.html\\\">Offerings</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/blends.html\\\">Mixes</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/shop.html\\\">Boutique</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/pricing.html\\\">Tiers</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/about.html\\\">The Root</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/book.html\\\">Reserve</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"/contact.html\\\" aria-current=\\\"page\\\" style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Connect</a>\\n    </nav>\\n\\n    <header class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"intro card\\\" role=\\\"region\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"hero-heading\\\">\\n        <h1 id=\\\"hero-heading\\\">A fragrant moment, arranged with care</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">I guide seasonal scent series and intimate workshops that honor safety, simplicity, and slow breaths. For groups and private events in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} — let us craft an olfactory rhythm together.</p>\\n        <div class=\\\"grid-3\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"false\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"pill small\\\"><strong>Host:</strong> {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"pill small\\\"><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"pill small\\\"><strong>Email:</strong> <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <a class=\\\"btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"card\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"events\\\">\\n        <h3 id=\\\"events\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:0;color:var(--leaf)\\\">Events & Series</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted small\\\">Seasonal series tailored for groups: workshops, scent-writing nights, and community blends. Each session centers safety, clear dilution guidance, and an accessible scent vocabulary.</p>\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\" class=\\\"muted small\\\">\\n          <strong>Typical format:</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"process\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"step\\\"><strong>1. Intro</strong><div class=\\\"small\\\">Scent history + safety</div></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"step\\\"><strong>2. Create</strong><div class=\\\"small\\\">Hands-on blending with measured dilutions</div></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"step\\\"><strong>3. Takeaway</strong><div class=\\\"small\\\">A small vial & home notes</div></div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"card\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"social\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:22px\\\">\\n      <h3 id=\\\"social\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px 0;color:var(--accent)\\\">Warm words</h3>\\n      <p class=\\\"muted small\\\">A few voices from past gatherings.</p>\\n      <div class=\\\"grid-3\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <blockquote class=\\\"pill small\\\">\\\"A gentle, thoughtful evening — the blends felt like memories.\\\"<br/><cite>— L.</cite></blockquote>\\n        <blockquote class=\\\"pill small\\\">\\\"Clear instructions and a calm room. I learned safe ways to bring scent home.\\\"<br/><cite>— M.</cite></blockquote>\\n        <blockquote class=\\\"pill small\\\">\\\"Our team left with small vials and big smiles. Perfectly paced.\\\"<br/><cite>— R.</cite></blockquote>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"card\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"benefits\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:22px\\\">\\n      <h3 id=\\\"benefits\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px 0;color:var(--leaf)\\\">Why gather this way</h3>\\n      <ul class=\\\"muted small\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 0 0 18px\\\">\\n        <li>Hands-on, small-batch experience — learn safe dilution and labeling.</li>\\n        <li>Careful sourcing and transparency about essentials and carrier oils.</li>\\n        <li>Gentle language: descriptions are sensory, not medical.</li>\\n      </ul>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"card\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"faq\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:22px\\\">\\n      <h3 id=\\\"faq\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px 0;color:var(--accent)\\\">Common questions</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"faq\\\">\\n        <details>\\n          <summary>How do you handle dilution?</summary>\\n          <div class=\\\"small muted\\\" style=\\\"padding:8px 12px\\\">All blending in workshops uses clear dilution tables and measured carrier oils. Participants are shown how to calculate safe dilutions for topical use (suggested ranges only). We never give medical advice.</div>\\n        </details>\\n        <details>\\n          <summary>Should I patch test?</summary>\\n          <div class=\\\"small muted\\\" style=\\\"padding:8px 12px\\\">Yes. A brief patch-test protocol is demonstrated and encouraged for all topical blends. If you have known sensitivities, please inform the host before the session.</div>\\n        </details>\\n        <details>\\n          <summary>What about pets?</summary>\\n          <div class=\\\"small muted\\\" style=\\\"padding:8px 12px\\\">Some aromas can affect animals. Sessions aim for pet-friendly practices: low airborne concentration, ventilation, and separate storage. Contact us with specifics about your pet if you plan to bring them.</div>\\n        </details>\\n        <details>\\n          <summary>Can I attend while pregnant?</summary>\\n          <div class=\\\"small muted\\\" style=\\\"padding:8px 12px\\\">Safety during pregnancy requires individual consideration. We encourage you to consult your care provider and to let the host know — we can adapt blends and offer fragrance-free options.</div>\\n        </details>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"card\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"connect\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:22px\\\">\\n      <h3 id=\\\"connect\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px 0;color:var(--leaf)\\\">Connect & reserve</h3>\\n      <p class=\\\"small muted\\\">Use the form to ask about event dates, group sizes, accessibility needs, or to request a private series.</p>\\n      <form class=\\\"contact-form\\\" action=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" method=\\\"post\\\" enctype=\\\"text/plain\\\" onsubmit=\\\"alert('This demo sends via your mail client to {{EMAIL}}');\\\">\\n        <input name=\\\"name\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"Your name\\\" required>\\n        <input name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Your email\\\" required>\\n        <select name=\\\"inquiry\\\" aria-label=\\\"Purpose\\\">\\n          <option>Request a private series</option>\\n          <option>Join an upcoming workshop</option>\\n          <option>Corporate / team event</option>\\n          <option>General question</option>\\n        </select>\\n        <textarea name=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"Tell us about your group, preferred dates, and any accessibility or safety notes...\\\"></textarea>\\n        <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center\\\">\\n          <button class=\\\"btn-primary\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Send request</button>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted small\\\">Or call <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></div>\\n        </div>\\n      </form>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"card\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"magnet\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:22px\\\">\\n      <h3 id=\\\"magnet\\\" style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px 0;color:var(--accent)\\\">A small guide for hosts</h3>\\n      <p class=\\\"muted small\\\">Sign up to receive a concise PDF: \\\"Hosting a Safe Seasonal Scent Series\\\" — a checklist for space, dilution, and pet-friendly tips.</p>\\n      <div class=\\\"lead-magnet\\\">\\n        <input type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Your email\\\" aria-label=\\\"Email for guide\\\">\\n        <button class=\\\"btn-primary\\\">Send the guide</button>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer class=\\\"cta\\\" role=\\\"contentinfo\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:700;color:var(--leaf)\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div class=\\\"muted small\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div style=\\\"text-align:right\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"muted small\\\">Ready to host?</div>\\n        <a class=\\\"btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </main>\\n\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"Chunk 4 — contact.html + README\\n\\nThis bundle provides the contact page for the aromatherapy practice and a brief README.\\n\\nFiles:\\n- contact.html: Full contact & events landing page. Includes these required sections: hero, social_proof, benefits, process, faq, lead_magnet, cta. The layout follows an earthy_warm palette and a minimal_poetic voice suitable for events_series offerings.\\n\\nPlaceholders present (must be replaced at runtime):\\n- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}\\n- {{TAGLINE}}\\n- {{PHONE}}\\n- {{EMAIL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\n- {{CITY}}\\n- {{STATE}}\\n- {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}\\n- {{FAVORITE_BLEND}} (not used on this page but reserved site-wide)\\n\\nNotes:\\n- No external assets or CDNs are used; the page creates a repeating SVG pattern inline to achieve texture.\\n- The contact form is only a UI demo and uses a mailto: action for placeholder behavior; integrate with your backend or form service as needed.\\n- FAQ is safety-forward: includes dilution guidance, patch testing, pets, and pregnancy notes. Avoids medical claims.\\n- Navigation labels are intentionally varied (Gather, Offerings, Mixes, Boutique, Tiers, The Root, Reserve, Connect) to keep templates distinct.\\n\\nUsage:\\n- Drop this file into your site root alongside the other pages.\\n- Replace placeholders with real values.\\n- Optionally wire the form to an endpoint and swap mailto action.\\n\\nDesign:\\n- Visual richness uses CSS and an inline SVG pattern; tweak colors in the :root for brand alignment.\\n\\nEnd of chunk 4.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
